#verification_scope:
  1. Seed DB: reseed so there is data to test against
  2. /modbus-gateways page: list renders, create opens modal
  3. GatewayModal: TCP fields vs RTU fields switch correctly on protocol change
  4. GatewayModal: register rows can be added/removed, submit works
  5. GatewayDetailPanel: start/stop/test buttons call correct endpoints + toast
  6. GatewayDetailPanel: register list renders with address/type/unit columns
  7. ModbusTab in Application Detail: scoped to applicationId, shows gateways
  8. Sidebar Modbus link: active state highlights correctly on /modbus-gateways
  9. Build: pnpm build --filter=web must pass (currently passes)

#constraints:
  - Fix bugs found during verification only — no scope creep
  - TCP fields: host + port; RTU fields: serialPort + baudRate (conditional)
  - Use existing toast (sonner) for all feedback
  - No new Redux slice — React Query only
  - simulator runs on localhost:1502 (node scripts/modbus-simulator.js 1502)
